---
name: Bubbles and Blooms
ingredients:
  - type: Blueberries, blackberries, or raspberries
    amount: '2'
    unit: tbsp
    garnish: false
  - type: Simple syrup
    amount: '2'
    unit: tsp
    garnish: false
  - type: Vodka
    amount: '1'
    unit: oz
    garnish: false
  - type: Elderflower liqueur
    amount: '1'
    unit: oz
    garnish: false
  - type: Lemon juice
    amount: 1/4
    unit: oz
    garnish: false
  - type: Dry sparkling wine
    amount: '2'
    unit: oz
    garnish: false
category:
  - gin
  - vodka
image: ../../images/cocktails/bubbles-and-blooms/image.jpg
sourceUrl: https://www.americastestkitchen.com/recipes/13528-bubbles-and-blooms
---
1. Add **2 tablespoons berries** and **½ teaspoon simple syrup** to base of cocktail shaker and muddle until berries are broken down and all juice has been expressed, about 30 seconds.
1. Add **1 ounce vodka**, **1 ounce elderflower**
   **liqueur**, and **¼ ounce lemon juice**, then fill shaker with ice. Shake mixture until fully combined and well chilled, about 15 seconds. Double-strain vodka mixture into chilled flute glass.
1. Slowly add **2 ounces sparkling wine** and, using bar spoon, gently lift vodka mixture from bottom of glass to top to combine.
1. Garnish with **berries** and serve.
